{"id": 117, "name": "Fredrinn", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3834313607fefe7bf2c895f042d60f10.png", "cls": ["Fighter", "Tank"], "specialty": ["Damage", "Chase"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["80", "50", "60", "40"], "lanes": ["Jungle", ""], "story": "A master treasure appraiser in Los Pecados accumulating wealth and searching for his lost friend.", "skills": [{"name": "Crystalline Armor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ffe5821a5ea1c1bd39f0db4f2cef947d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Fredrinn gains 1 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Combo Point</span> that lasts 5s each time his skill hits a non-minion enemy, up to 4 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Combo Points</span>. His Ultimates cost different numbers of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Combo Points</span>.\n\nFredrinn stores 100% of the damage he receives as <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Crystal Energy</span>, which decays after 5s at a rate of 10% Max HP per second.\nFredrinn can convert the stored <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Crystal Energy</span> into HP by 20% of his damage dealt (10% for damage dealt to minions). Gaining a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Combo Point</span> resets the decaying timer."}, {"name": "Piercing Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4945b0e50c9f2fdad8814a8451861a86.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 12, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "188,55,55"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7.5", "desc": "Fredrinn thrusts his sword in the target direction, dealing 125<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+7% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fba51f\">(+120% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit and slowing them by 30% for 2s. His next Basic Attack gains extra attack range and deals 85<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>.\nThis skill deals 200% damage to non-hero enemies."}, {"name": "Brave Assault", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_dcd1b03082da5a690ba7a45196d5ff13.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7.5", "desc": "Fredrinn dashes in the target direction, dealing 140<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the first non-minion enemy hit. His next Basic Attack knocks the target airborne for 0.3s."}, {"name": "Energy Eruption", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1b377f78451ed0315312ed90835a01c9.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Fredrinn deals 210<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to nearby enemies and taunts them for 1s. Hitting a non-minion enemy grants Fredrinn 25 Physical & Magic Defense for 3s and reduces the cooldowns of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Piercing Strike</span> and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Brave Assault</span> by 75%.\nThis skill costs 1 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Combo Point</span>."}, {"name": "Appraiser's Wrath", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_775f49d622b6611bc97a10108ead401c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Fredrinn slams his sword in the target direction (this skill can only be interrupted by Suppression), dealing 600 plus 21% of his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Crystal Energy</span> as <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in a fan-shaped area after a short delay. Enemies in the center of the area take 175% damage. This skill doubles the conversion ratio based on damage dealt to enemy heroes from stored <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Crystal Energy</span> to HP.\nThis skill costs 3 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Combo Points</span>."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots - Dire Hit", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6e5971b429e55f59cf100d8920cd7c32.png"}, {"name": "Brute Force Breastplate", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b830fbf0e825c3c46010bf5fbf814767.png"}, {"name": "Oracle", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_bc24b55abbbec6da408eb0ea5c37cad4.png"}, {"name": "Radiant Armor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2235566ea07c98eeece80a2cb56c296f.png"}, {"name": "Antique Cuirass", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f20c5fef57268ccb59a1b818c0b0c769.png"}, {"name": "Guardian Helmet", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fc3154808d5848c4b3d28ea921ee58b9.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Support", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3bd7417bce76995285722e25d8ff5ebd.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Vitality", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_64ef8e6e240938f10705dd24e0989d30.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Seasoned Hunter", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fe6ad272b01110393d55b4326164a3fa.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "Impure Rage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_30fc47f40c0ef7fb770d98d6f570f404.png", "tier": 3}], "spell": {"name": "Retribution", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2cd084a2661c121c347facb060a80377.png"}}, {"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots", "